[{"text": "And now I give the floor to his", "start": 0.08, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "excellency Muhammad Salm Merzuk,", "start": 1.92, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Minister for Foreign Affairs, African", "start": 5.279, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "Cooperation and Moritanians Abroad of", "start": 7.6, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "Moritania.", "start": 10.24, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "In the name of God, the compassionate,", "start": 27.359, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "the merciful.", "start": 29.119, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "Peace and prayers be upon his prophet.", "start": 31.439, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "Your excellency,", "start": 35.28, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "Mr. President.", "start": 37.28, "duration": 3.48}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 41.2, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Mr. Antonio Guterish, Secretary General", "start": 44.239, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "of the United Nations.", "start": 46.879, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "Honorable ministers, ambassadors, ladies", "start": 48.96, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "and gentlemen, peace and blessings be", "start": 53.199, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "upon you.", "start": 56.0, "duration": 2.64}, {"text": "At the outset,", "start": 59.68, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "I would like to express my sincere", "start": 62.879, "duration": 8.001}, {"text": "congratulations to Dr. Khali Rahman on", "start": 65.439, "duration": 8.961}, {"text": "assuming the presidency of the 81st", "start": 70.88, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "session of the United Nations General", "start": 74.4, "duration": 5.399}, {"text": "Assembly.", "start": 76.799, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "I am", "start": 80.88, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "convinced that his great experience", "start": 82.88, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "and acumen will contribute", "start": 87.119, "duration": 7.921}, {"text": "in the successful conduct of the work of", "start": 91.04, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "this session. I would also like to", "start": 95.04, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "express my sincere thanks", "start": 98.24, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "to her excellency", "start": 101.6, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "Analina Barbar for the excellent", "start": 104.32, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "stewardship of the 80th session of the", "start": 107.68, "duration": 7.439}, {"text": "United Nations General Assembly", "start": 111.68, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "would like to thank his excellency Mr.", "start": 115.119, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "Antonio Guterish, the Secretary General", "start": 118.0, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "of the United Nations, for his concerted", "start": 119.92, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "effort to develop the United Nations and", "start": 122.88, "duration": 9.359}, {"text": "promote its role. Mr. President,", "start": 126.719, "duration": 8.001}, {"text": "it is my honor", "start": 132.239, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "to convey to this distinguished", "start": 134.72, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "gathering the greetings of his", "start": 137.2, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "excellency", "start": 139.36, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "uh the president", "start": 141.52, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "of", "start": 143.68, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "Moritania", "start": 145.52, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Muhammad Wilwani", "start": 148.959, "duration": 3.481}, {"text": "and he wishes all the success for this", "start": 152.56, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "session.", "start": 156.0, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "His Excellency", "start": 158.319, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "honored me", "start": 160.72, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "to address the General Assembly on his", "start": 163.44, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "behalf. The theme of this session,", "start": 167.84, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "restoring trust, managing", "start": 170.319, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "transformation,", "start": 172.72, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "a united nations that delivers for all,", "start": 174.239, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "reflects the core of our", "start": 177.92, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "responsibilities", "start": 180.48, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "towards", "start": 182.48, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "the common goal of this organization", "start": 184.239, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "that was established after the horrors", "start": 187.28, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "of the 20th century.", "start": 190.0, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "They decided to rely on the strength of", "start": 193.36, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "law and not that of the might. They", "start": 196.4, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "decided to choose dialogue instead of", "start": 200.239, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "confrontation.", "start": 203.04, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Our responsibility today is to maintain", "start": 205.36, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "this cause", "start": 208.56, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "and we have to counter the selectivity", "start": 211.44, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "in applying international law especially", "start": 214.239, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "when there is a systematic", "start": 218.64, "duration": 7.679}, {"text": "avoidance of collective commitments.", "start": 222.319, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "Some countries do not want to uphold the", "start": 226.319, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "same rules that they call on others to", "start": 229.68, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "uphold.", "start": 232.56, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "This", "start": 234.319, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "leads to weakened", "start": 236.0, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "collective cooperation mechanisms. We no", "start": 239.12, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "longer can prevent conflicts or settle", "start": 242.4, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "them.", "start": 245.519, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "This danger extends to institutions that", "start": 247.68, "duration": 8.68}, {"text": "might falter and fail.", "start": 252.08, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "Multilateralism", "start": 256.799, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "is not limited to the interests and", "start": 259.04, "duration": 9.52}, {"text": "sovereignty of states. It is not um a an", "start": 262.96, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "example of weakness. It's instead it is", "start": 268.56, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "a necessity to ensure human dignity,", "start": 271.6, "duration": 8.92}, {"text": "bring peace and confront challenges.", "start": 275.44, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "Defending the United Nations is a", "start": 280.72, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "defense of the right of all", "start": 282.96, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "peoples to determine their future and", "start": 286.639, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "participate in decision making those", "start": 290.24, "duration": 8.72}, {"text": "decisions that define their destiny.", "start": 293.199, "duration": 11.0}, {"text": "We want a more just United Nations,", "start": 298.96, "duration": 5.239}, {"text": "a United Nations capable of confronting", "start": 304.96, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "the current challenge challenges.", "start": 308.16, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "After more than eight decades since the", "start": 311.68, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "establishment of the UN, the Security", "start": 314.08, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Council reform has become a necessity to", "start": 317.12, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "ensure", "start": 320.24, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "a fair representation of Africa", "start": 322.96, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "including permanent and non-permanent", "start": 325.919, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "uh um membership", "start": 329.44, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "while reviewing the financial", "start": 332.56, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "architecture. This will ensure a", "start": 334.8, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "participate a a cooperation on equal", "start": 338.0, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "footing and open greater opportunities", "start": 340.16, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "for development. The reform of this", "start": 342.8, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "organization cannot be complete without", "start": 345.199, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "promoting its ability to meet the", "start": 348.32, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "promises of development.", "start": 351.28, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "As 2030 approaches, we call for", "start": 354.32, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "accelerating the implementation of the", "start": 358.479, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "SDGs", "start": 360.8, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "and we support the UN80 initiative as", "start": 362.88, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "well as the pact of the future. Mr.", "start": 367.28, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "President, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 369.84, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "the Islamic Republic of Moritania", "start": 373.36, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "renews its commitment to the principles", "start": 376.24, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "and purposes of the UN charter and the", "start": 378.96, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "norms of international law as well as", "start": 381.28, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "the resolutions of international", "start": 383.759, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "legitimacy. Our foreign policy is based", "start": 386.639, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "on good neighborliness, the respect of", "start": 390.24, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "states sovereignty", "start": 393.44, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "uh independence and the non-interference", "start": 396.4, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "in their internal affairs as well as the", "start": 399.12, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "peaceful settlement of disputes and", "start": 401.52, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "ensuring the just causes. Proceeding", "start": 404.72, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "from such principles, my country under", "start": 407.52, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "the leadership of his excellency the", "start": 411.36, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "president of the state Muhammad wrai", "start": 413.039, "duration": 9.28}, {"text": "continue to build a modern state that is", "start": 416.479, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "coexistent", "start": 422.319, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "in synergy with its neighbors and open", "start": 423.919, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "to the entire world. On the national", "start": 428.08, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "level, we have adopted a comprehensive", "start": 430.639, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "strategy", "start": 434.24, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "with its political, economic,", "start": 436.16, "duration": 8.479}, {"text": "social and security dimensions. We made", "start": 440.96, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "dialogue consult and consultation the", "start": 444.639, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "pattern for uh public", "start": 447.919, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "offices. Thus, his excellency the", "start": 451.759, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "president launched a comprehensive", "start": 454.88, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "national dialogue that is all inclusive.", "start": 457.84, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "It does not exclude any strata of", "start": 461.199, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "society to ensure consensus", "start": 463.68, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "on the development of our institutions", "start": 467.199, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "and entrench a state of law, a", "start": 470.4, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "democratic state that protects rights", "start": 474.16, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "and freedoms.", "start": 476.4, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "Turning to the social context, we", "start": 478.639, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "promote social cohesion", "start": 482.319, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "and community", "start": 486.479, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "unification", "start": 488.879, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "through fighting discrimination and", "start": 490.4, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "vulnerability while addressing any", "start": 493.039, "duration": 9.361}, {"text": "weakness inherited. We try to promote", "start": 498.56, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "the synergies and develop our economies", "start": 502.4, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "to limit poverty and provide the basic", "start": 506.96, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "services", "start": 510.0, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "to the most needy.", "start": 511.52, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "We have also expanded the medical", "start": 515.36, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "services through establishing a Medicare", "start": 518.479, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "fund", "start": 521.279, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "for all those who are not currently", "start": 522.88, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "covered with medical insurance. We", "start": 525.839, "duration": 7.761}, {"text": "provide certain basic medical services", "start": 528.88, "duration": 9.6}, {"text": "to the most in need,", "start": 533.6, "duration": 9.04}, {"text": "especially mothers, the the mothers, the", "start": 538.48, "duration": 8.479}, {"text": "elderly and those with disabilities.", "start": 542.64, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "Turning to education,", "start": 546.959, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "reforming", "start": 549.519, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "this sector is the basis of our effort", "start": 551.839, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "to provide high quality", "start": 554.72, "duration": 7.119}, {"text": "education that provides equal", "start": 558.88, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "opportunities and ensure equity. Turning", "start": 561.839, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "to good governance, we focus on", "start": 565.36, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "transparency, the independence of the", "start": 568.8, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "judiciary and combating corruption while", "start": 571.36, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "reforming", "start": 575.279, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "public offices and promoting investment.", "start": 577.279, "duration": 7.921}, {"text": "Our", "start": 582.56, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "approach", "start": 585.2, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "addresses", "start": 588.88, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "the hiking prices", "start": 590.8, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "um confronting any uh threats to the", "start": 593.68, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "security or terrorism while tackling", "start": 597.44, "duration": 6.92}, {"text": "also vulnerability and poverty.", "start": 599.92, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "The complimentarity between all those", "start": 607.279, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "dimensions ensured our country's", "start": 609.6, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "security and stability in an environment", "start": 612.959, "duration": 9.201}, {"text": "full with disruptions. Mr. President", "start": 616.8, "duration": 8.56}, {"text": "Moritan Moritania adopts a balanced", "start": 622.16, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "approach that", "start": 625.36, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "covers", "start": 627.76, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "all our", "start": 629.36, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "inheritances be it African, Islamic,", "start": 631.36, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "Arab and others. We are guided by our", "start": 634.56, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "foreign policy underpinned on", "start": 638.32, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "cooperation, solidarity and the respect", "start": 640.88, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "of sovereignty and good neighborliness.", "start": 644.24, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "Proceeding from the above, we believe", "start": 647.6, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "that confronting the common challenges", "start": 650.399, "duration": 8.081}, {"text": "necessitates promoting multilateralism.", "start": 653.76, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "We need concert the concerted effort of", "start": 658.48, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "the international community.", "start": 661.36, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "In a practical translation of such", "start": 663.68, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "effort, my country", "start": 667.04, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "through its participation in the", "start": 670.0, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "different", "start": 673.279, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "events and peacekeeping missions", "start": 675.12, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "contributes in the peaceful settlement", "start": 678.24, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "of disputes and promoting cooperation", "start": 680.0, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "and coordination both regionally and", "start": 683.839, "duration": 5.641}, {"text": "internationally.", "start": 686.48, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "This contribution is based in our belief", "start": 691.6, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "in the need to have durable and um just", "start": 693.68, "duration": 9.2}, {"text": "cooperation because no one country no", "start": 699.2, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "matter how powerful it was can stand", "start": 702.88, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "alone to confront the challenges of such", "start": 706.48, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "an interconnected world.", "start": 709.44, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "COVID 19", "start": 712.48, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "and the subsequent disruptions in the", "start": 715.36, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "supply chains", "start": 720.16, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "of food and energy as well as the", "start": 722.72, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "conflicts and wars demonstrated how the", "start": 725.519, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "interests of states are in", "start": 728.959, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "interconnected along with their peace", "start": 730.48, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "and security.", "start": 732.399, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "Migration is at the core of such common", "start": 734.639, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "challenges.", "start": 737.92, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "People's", "start": 740.32, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "mobility", "start": 743.76, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "strives for a better future, better job", "start": 746.24, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "opportunities, better better", "start": 749.519, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "development. However, the high influx of", "start": 751.519, "duration": 8.961}, {"text": "migration and their complexity", "start": 755.76, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "reveals", "start": 760.48, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "the reality that should be", "start": 763.04, "duration": 9.359}, {"text": "analyzed without any exaggeration", "start": 767.92, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "exaggerations", "start": 772.399, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "and it should also preserve the unity of", "start": 775.12, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "societies.", "start": 778.079, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "We need an effective response to this", "start": 779.76, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "challenge through cooperation between", "start": 783.04, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "the countries of origin, transit and", "start": 785.12, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "destination.", "start": 788.8, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "We have to ensure a fair share of the", "start": 790.639, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "responsibilities and burns and address", "start": 794.24, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "the root causes of irregular migration", "start": 796.399, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "while combating human trafficking", "start": 799.68, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "and smuggling.", "start": 803.68, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "to contain such influxes and ensure at", "start": 806.88, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "the same time the dignity of migrants", "start": 810.959, "duration": 5.961}, {"text": "and their rights.", "start": 813.44, "duration": 3.48}, {"text": "The solution is in our common", "start": 818.32, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "responsibility and solidarity.", "start": 821.36, "duration": 7.159}, {"text": "Mr. president.", "start": 825.04, "duration": 3.479}, {"text": "The expanded theater of conflicts and", "start": 829.76, "duration": 9.519}, {"text": "the escalating humanitarian cost of such", "start": 834.88, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "conflicts requires greater protection of", "start": 839.279, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "civilians while ensuring the peaceful", "start": 842.8, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "settlement of such disputes for the sake", "start": 845.279, "duration": 7.321}, {"text": "and benefit of communities.", "start": 848.48, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "the systematic destruction witnessed in", "start": 853.04, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "the Palestinian territory and the", "start": 856.0, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "ensuring", "start": 858.8, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "fall of victims and displacement", "start": 860.399, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "are of the responsibility of the", "start": 863.839, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "international community, especially the", "start": 865.6, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "United Nations. We have to protect the", "start": 868.079, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "Palestinian people and end their", "start": 870.16, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "suffering. In this vein, we renew our", "start": 872.32, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "support for a just and lasting solution", "start": 875.519, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "to the Palestinian coals based on the", "start": 878.399, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "peace the Arab peace initiative and the", "start": 882.72, "duration": 8.119}, {"text": "UN resolutions", "start": 886.399, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "to establish the state of Palestine that", "start": 892.959, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "is independent,", "start": 896.32, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "viable along the lines of the 4th of", "start": 898.399, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "June", "start": 900.399, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "19", "start": 902.24, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "67", "start": 904.16, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "with East Jerusalem as its capital.", "start": 907.12, "duration": 9.36}, {"text": "We appreciate the mediation effort", "start": 911.199, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "undertaken by the United States of", "start": 916.48, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "America, Egypt, Qatar to Turkey,", "start": 918.8, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "Turkey.", "start": 922.72, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "and we stress the need to implement", "start": 924.639, "duration": 7.921}, {"text": "the Security Council resolution 2803", "start": 928.56, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "issued on the 17th of November 2025 on", "start": 932.56, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "the peace plan in Gaza. This will bring", "start": 936.32, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "about peace and ensure reconstruction in", "start": 938.959, "duration": 8.281}, {"text": "the Gaza Strip.", "start": 943.68, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "We would like to recall the historic", "start": 948.24, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "step", "start": 951.759, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "taken by a number of European countries", "start": 954.56, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "over the past year when they recognized", "start": 957.04, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "the state of Palestine.", "start": 961.44, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "We do welcome and commend", "start": 964.8, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "the recent measures undertaken by a", "start": 968.8, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "number of European countries to impose", "start": 972.16, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "sanctions on Israeli settlers", "start": 974.959, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "who have been implicated in violent acts", "start": 979.04, "duration": 8.239}, {"text": "against the Palestinian people. However,", "start": 983.199, "duration": 7.681}, {"text": "even though they're important, but such", "start": 987.279, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "initiatives should not be isolated.", "start": 990.88, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "Instead, they should be a driver for", "start": 994.32, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "more firm international action", "start": 998.56, "duration": 8.48}, {"text": "to put an end to the settlement activity", "start": 1001.92, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "while opening", "start": 1007.04, "duration": 6.84}, {"text": "the horizon for the two-state solution.", "start": 1008.959, "duration": 4.921}, {"text": "Paradoxically", "start": 1017.68, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "that we have denied the Palestinian", "start": 1023.12, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "people from participating in this", "start": 1026.559, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "international forum at a time when the", "start": 1029.36, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "Palestinian question is at the forefront", "start": 1032.4, "duration": 6.039}, {"text": "of our agenda.", "start": 1034.959, "duration": 3.48}, {"text": "At a time when the Palestinian cause", "start": 1043.36, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "comes at the forefront of the", "start": 1046.16, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "international agenda,", "start": 1047.76, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "they were not able to attend this", "start": 1050.16, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "go contravenes the spirit of dialogue", "start": 1054.72, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "and pluralism that the United Nations is", "start": 1058.48, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "underpinned upon. In this domain, we", "start": 1061.6, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "stress that the state of Palestine", "start": 1064.96, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "has gained the recognition of most of", "start": 1068.24, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "the member states of the United Nations.", "start": 1072.0, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "This reflects a wide range", "start": 1074.96, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "uh support, international support of the", "start": 1078.72, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Palestinian people and their", "start": 1082.64, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "establishment of an independent", "start": 1084.48, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "statehood. Therefore, we call for the um", "start": 1086.24, "duration": 9.04}, {"text": "the participation of", "start": 1092.32, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "the Palestinian the Palestinians in the", "start": 1095.28, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "UN forums so that they can achieve their", "start": 1098.64, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "aspirations and defend their just cause", "start": 1102.799, "duration": 7.161}, {"text": "before the international community.", "start": 1105.76, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "We renew our support to the people of", "start": 1121.36, "duration": 10.88}, {"text": "Lebanon in the face of the violations", "start": 1125.84, "duration": 9.6}, {"text": "that they have endured. We have to end", "start": 1132.24, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "their suffering and ensure their", "start": 1135.44, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "sovereignty. We are also standing in", "start": 1136.96, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "solidarity with Sudan.", "start": 1139.76, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "We are committed to Sudan's unity,", "start": 1142.799, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "sovereignty, and territorial integrity.", "start": 1146.08, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "We call for an immediate end to this", "start": 1148.72, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "war, giving priority to dialogue while", "start": 1151.28, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "protecting civilians and ending their", "start": 1155.52, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "suffering.", "start": 1157.52, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Turning to Libya, we support the UN", "start": 1159.2, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "efforts and the African Union's effort", "start": 1162.64, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "to reach a permanent settlement that", "start": 1165.039, "duration": 8.161}, {"text": "would maintain the country's unity and", "start": 1169.039, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "sovereign sovereignty while ensuring", "start": 1173.2, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "peace and stability to the people of", "start": 1175.84, "duration": 9.24}, {"text": "Libya. We renew our support", "start": 1178.24, "duration": 6.84}, {"text": "to the efforts made", "start": 1185.36, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "um", "start": 1191.36, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "in the", "start": 1192.96, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "in Yemen and the initiatives taken by", "start": 1200.32, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "the Arab uh countries as well as the", "start": 1204.0, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "Kingdom of Saudi Arabia to support that", "start": 1207.36, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "country.", "start": 1209.919, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "We stress our principled position on the", "start": 1212.24, "duration": 9.84}, {"text": "conflict of the Western Sahara", "start": 1216.799, "duration": 7.921}, {"text": "uh and hope to reach a just and", "start": 1222.08, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "sustainable solution that will be", "start": 1224.72, "duration": 6.04}, {"text": "accepted to all parties.", "start": 1226.72, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "We express our deep concern", "start": 1230.799, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "towards the military escalation in the", "start": 1234.799, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Middle East.", "start": 1237.039, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "and the resulting threat to the entire", "start": 1239.039, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "region", "start": 1242.24, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "and its stability. The repercussions of", "start": 1243.84, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "which would also reach the Strait of", "start": 1246.96, "duration": 7.32}, {"text": "Haras and the", "start": 1249.28, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "regional and international navigation in", "start": 1254.32, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "this important water way. We support the", "start": 1256.32, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Kingdom of Saudi Arabia, the United Arab", "start": 1260.159, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "Emirates, the state of Qatar, and the", "start": 1261.76, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "Kingdom of Bahrain and Kuwait", "start": 1264.24, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "as well as the Heshite Kingdom of", "start": 1269.2, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "Jordan. Um, in the face of the attacks", "start": 1271.84, "duration": 10.04}, {"text": "against their stability and security.", "start": 1276.799, "duration": 5.081}, {"text": "We have to preserve states, territories", "start": 1285.2, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "and call upon all countries to", "start": 1289.6, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "deescalate and ensure self-restraint,", "start": 1292.48, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "ensure dialogue", "start": 1296.4, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "and", "start": 1298.88, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "save the region and its peoples from", "start": 1300.48, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "more crises and sufferings.", "start": 1303.36, "duration": 9.28}, {"text": "Mr. President. Ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 1307.44, "duration": 10.28}, {"text": "the world today faces", "start": 1312.64, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "an important moment that goes beyond", "start": 1319.28, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "political challenges.", "start": 1324.08, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "It there are acute cha humanitarian,", "start": 1327.28, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "environmental", "start": 1331.12, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "and economic challenges. My country,", "start": 1332.72, "duration": 7.56}, {"text": "Mauritania,", "start": 1337.28, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "knows full well the importance and", "start": 1340.559, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "sensitivity of this moment.", "start": 1343.44, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "We would like to stress with humility", "start": 1346.559, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "from this common home that brings us", "start": 1351.44, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "together from the United Nations that we", "start": 1354.559, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "all shoulder this responsibility before", "start": 1357.84, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "history.", "start": 1361.679, "duration": 3.681}, {"text": "We have to leave to the future", "start": 1363.76, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "generations a better world than the one", "start": 1365.36, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "we've inherited.", "start": 1367.84, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "We are capable of that once we redirect", "start": 1369.76, "duration": 10.159}, {"text": "ourselves to the path of peace through", "start": 1375.919, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "renewing our common", "start": 1379.919, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "and joint effort. The United Nations", "start": 1383.44, "duration": 7.119}, {"text": "must regain its effectiveness to serve", "start": 1387.12, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "peace and security, especially common", "start": 1390.559, "duration": 8.401}, {"text": "security. We can do that if we", "start": 1393.76, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "rightfully address the deep", "start": 1398.96, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "transformations", "start": 1402.0, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "that are reshaping the entire", "start": 1404.08, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "international landscape. The these are", "start": 1407.6, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "the", "start": 1411.76, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "provisions of the 2030", "start": 1413.919, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "agenda,", "start": 1417.36, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "its goals and objectives", "start": 1420.08, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "and the expanded scope of knowledge, the", "start": 1423.44, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "accelerated technology", "start": 1427.12, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "and their subsequent results and", "start": 1429.679, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "impacts. We can do that if we return", "start": 1432.72, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "with wisdom", "start": 1437.039, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "to", "start": 1439.039, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "what our founding fathers", "start": 1441.12, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "have been guided upon. the common", "start": 1444.72, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "principles and purposes that gather us", "start": 1447.84, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "under the umbrella of the United Nations", "start": 1451.919, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "for more than eight decades by bringing", "start": 1454.08, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "hope that", "start": 1457.76, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "good governance,", "start": 1460.64, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "technological development", "start": 1463.84, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "and the advancement will be an addition", "start": 1466.559, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "that will be in all our benefits that", "start": 1469.52, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "will save the entire humanity", "start": 1472.559, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "from the current challenges. Thank you", "start": 1476.72, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "and peace and blessings of God be upon", "start": 1478.559, "duration": 4.681}, {"text": "you.", "start": 1480.24, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "I thank the Minister of Foreign Affairs,", "start": 1491.279, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "Afghan Cooperation and Moritanians", "start": 1494.72, "duration": 7.16}, {"text": "Abroad of Moritania.", "start": 1497.44, "duration": 4.44}]